---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import heroImage from '../assets/home-hero';
---

<Layout
	title="Sites By Andrew"
	description="Practical websites and small-business solutions that help local cleaning companies look credible and win better enquiries."
>
	<section class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[78rem] gap-10 px-5 pb-16 pt-6 sm:px-8 sm:pt-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-16 lg:px-10 lg:pb-24 lg:pt-14">
		<div class="max-w-[39rem]">
			<p class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-citrus"></span>For local cleaning businesses</p>
			<h1 class="max-w-[11ch] font-display text-[clamp(3.5rem,9vw,7.6rem)] font-semibold leading-[0.88] tracking-[-0.075em] text-ink">Make the next job easier to win.</h1>
			<p class="mt-8 max-w-[33rem] text-lg leading-8 text-ink-soft sm:text-xl">A clear, credible website for the people who keep your town running. Sites By Andrew gives small cleaning businesses a sharper way to be found, trusted, and contacted.</p>
			<div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5">
				<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-blue px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-paper transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-blue-deep" href="/contact">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				<a class="font-bold text-ink underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-blue" href="/services">See what I can fix</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="relative">
			<div class="absolute -right-2 -top-5 z-10 hidden rotate-3 rounded-full bg-citrus px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-ink shadow-sm sm:block">Less chasing. More cleaning.</div>
			<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-paper-deep">
				<img class="aspect-[4/3] h-auto w-full object-cover" src={heroImage.src} alt="A professional cleaning team member preparing a bright, tidy workspace" width="1440" height="810" fetchpriority="high" />
			</div>
			<div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft"><span>Built for local reach</span><span>01 / 04</span></div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="why" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[78rem] px-5 pb-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:pb-28">
		<div class="grid gap-8 border-y border-line py-8 sm:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] sm:gap-12 sm:py-10">
			<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue">A better front door</p>
			<p class="max-w-[43rem] font-display text-2xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-4xl">You already do the hard work. Your website should make that obvious before the first call.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-10 pt-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-x-10 lg:pt-14">
			<div><p class="mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-clay">01</p><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Look established</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink-soft">Turn good work and real experience into a first impression people can trust.</p></div>
			<div><p class="mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-clay">02</p><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Get found locally</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink-soft">Make your service area, specialties, and availability easy to understand at a glance.</p></div>
			<div><p class="mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-clay">03</p><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Make contact simple</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink-soft">Give the right customers a clear next step, without a maze of buttons or jargon.</p></div>
			<div><p class="mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-clay">04</p><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">Keep it useful</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink-soft">A lightweight site that stays quick to update as your business grows.</p></div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mx-5 mb-8 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] bg-ink px-6 py-10 text-paper sm:mx-8 sm:px-10 sm:py-14 lg:mx-auto lg:max-w-[76rem] lg:px-16 lg:py-16">
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
			<div class="max-w-[38rem]"><p class="mb-5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-citrus">Start with the useful bit</p><h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.06em] sm:text-6xl">Your next customer is looking for a reason to choose you.</h2></div>
			<a class="inline-flex w-fit shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-citrus px-6 py-3.5 font-bold text-ink transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/contact">Build that reason <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
